  "body": "Opportunities to secure a brand-new home in this boutique coastal development are becoming increasingly rare, with only three residences remaining.\r\n\r\nPositioned in sought-after Campbells Bay, this stylish two-level home combines thoughtful architectural design, quality finishes and the increasingly valuable benefit of two dedicated parking spaces - an internal-access garage plus an additional off-street car park. That extra parking is a genuine point of difference compared with many new-build homes offering only one space.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n- Pleasant sea views\r\n- Light-filled open-plan living with seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n- Designer kitchen and bathrooms with premium appliances\r\n- Quality carpet throughout the upper-level bedrooms\r\n- Excellent position for families, professionals and downsizers alike\r\n- Zoned for Campbells Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Rangitoto College, Westlake Boys' High School and Westlake Girls' High School\r\n- Easy walking distance to Campbells Bay Beach, local reserves, playgrounds, cafés and Centennial Park\r\n\r\nWhether you're upsizing, downsizing, seeking a convenient lock-up-and-leave lifestyle, or looking to secure a quality investment in one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal suburbs, this home offers an exceptional combination of style, location, convenience and value.\r\n\r\nThe asking price is very reasonable - make your offer today.",
